      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">From Ikeja and Yaba on the Mainland to Lekki and Ajah on the Island, get two or three comparable written quotes from independent installers. Call now and ask for quotes that name the exact inverter, battery and panel models.</p>
